  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Slice zucchini into thin rounds.<br>• Place zucchini on a lined tray. Drizzle with olive oil, <br>season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, <br>20-25 minutes.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-d1240e00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, boil the kettle.<br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.<br>• Halve snacking tomatoes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-886de310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the zucchini has 10 minutes remaining,  <br>half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water and add <br>a generous pinch of salt.<br>• Cook spaghetti over high heat, until ‘al dente’,  <br>9 minutes.<br>• Reserve some pasta water (see ingredients).<br>• Drain spaghetti, then return to saucepan.  <br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly <br>firm in the centre</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-f6548e20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a good drizzle of olive oil <br>over medium-high heat.<br>• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute. Add light <br>cooking cream, stock concentrate and the <br>reserved pasta water, then simmer until slightly <br>thickened, 2-3 minutes.<br>• Remove pan from heat, then stir through roasted <br>zucchini, lemon zest, a generous squeeze of lemon <br>juice, the butter and cooked spaghetti until <br>combined. Season with pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-e6f5bd30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Just before serving, in a large bowl, combine <br>spinach &amp; rocket mix, tomatoes, Parmesan <br>cheese, pine nuts and a drizzle of balsamic <br>vinegar. Season to taste with salt and pepper.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-aa36f440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide roasted zucchini spaghetti between bowls. <br>• Dollop over small spoonfuls of ricotta and  <br>basil pesto.<br>• Serve with cherry tomato, Parmesan and pine nut <br>salad and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a4f9fcbc80ad488c9bcf4f9/step-f7267250.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
